✅ 5. setPriority() vs sleep()
| Feature       | `setPriority()` | `sleep()`       |
| ------------- | --------------- | --------------- |
| Purpose       | Scheduler hint  | Pause execution |
| Blocks Thread | ❌ No            | ✅ Yes           |
| Time-Based    | ❌ No            | ✅ Yes           |
| Releases Lock | ❌ No            | ❌ No            |